      "kind": "lidar",
      "note": "Regional 2 m grid, heights above local ground. Median 17.0 m, P90 22.43 m, maximum 22.54 m. West roof near 17.0 m, central 22.4 m, eastern 11.8 m. The heights describe stacked gym volumes and the sloping site."
    },
    {
      "kind": "kartaview",
      "note": "South facade has four tall buff bays between projecting rectangular piers, dark louvre strips and a pale ribbed upper box.",
