    },
    {
      "kind": "kartaview",
      "note": "Steps rise off the sidewalk below the corner with vertical glazing strips, white corrugated cladding and pale masonry. PIL means on the full frame at normalized (0.865,0.62), (0.92,0.40) and (0.81,0.38) supply masonry, panel and glass.",
