    {
      "kind": "photo",
      "note": "Four levels include stacked gyms and the common Thompson/WSRC front entry.",
      "url": "https://www.uwo.ca/campusrec/about/wsrc.html"
    },
    {
      "kind": "knowledge",
      "note": "Comparison of frame 146585635 with the east wall of the west gym places a single nearly full-height patch of mullioned glass near the southern corner, above a masonry base. The remaining upper surface is ribbed. Frame 79749215 shows four strongly modelled buff bays beside the silver panel block. The white intermediate roof patch at local (190,877) samples #f3f3ea."
    }
  ],
  "notes": "The north frontage bridges a grade change. Rectangular dark frames project from the curtain wall. Exact entrance offset, rear door spacing and plant dimensions are approximate. The lidar shows a 16 m northern atrium in front of the 22.5 m gym. The sloping front wall changes from four masonry bays to the set-back metal volume around x 229 m.",
